@seq 1
@entry RESEARCH
🔭 RESEARCH @codex.selected
Evidence(memory) → Evidence(task)
⊢ default_profile={web,llm-mem}
⊢ web=RO_PUBLIC ∧ llm-mem=RO_LOCAL
🔎 WEB
Obj(Task{keywords}) → Mor(web.search) → Sources
ERROR ⇒ Evidence(web=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(web=N_A(no_applicable_source))
🔎 MEMORY
Obj(Task{keywords}) → Mor(llm-mem.search[level=2,json]) → Precedents
ERROR ∨ missing_executable ⇒ Evidence(memory=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(memory=N_A(no_precedent))
⊢ report={Facts,Inferences,Unknowns,Sources,Precedents,Constraints}
⊢ delegate only when 2+ bounded independent workstreams ∨ ambiguity_or_high_impact
RESEARCH ⇒ 🧠 PLAN
